1	/**
2	 * verify-advanced-recompute.ts — Phase 2 advanced-stat recomputation.
3	 *
4	 * Recomputes the advanced shooting/usage metrics directly from the raw box score
5	 * in main.fact_player_game_stats (1.67M rows) and compares them to the stored
6	 * columns. Per-row mismatches land in audit.advanced_stat_recompute; one summary
7	 * row per metric lands in audit.dq_results.
8	 *
